22	- Name the server `{id}_{owner}_{name}`.
23	- Regardless of the deployment method used, create a dedicated project folder for this MCP server at the path `/home/silimon/MCP-Auto/mcp_server/{id}_{owner}_{name}`, and set this folder as the "cwd".
